{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-matalan-dungarees-rompers-and-sweater-sets-2511-0079","content_id":"e22efe2c-8726-4220-95ee-d23690c13515","description":"Product Recall for Matalan Dungarees, Rompers and Sweater Sets presenting a risk of injuries. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"905ba63b-269b-48f7-9fea-646e62876399","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-11-14T15:53:22+00:00","id":"905ba63b-269b-48f7-9fea-646e62876399","title":"Link to product images and PDF","updated_at":"2025-11-14T15:53:22+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/691750729d50fc2fe8161831/2511-0079-product-recall-matalan-dungarees-and-clothing__1_.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Matalan Dungarees, Rompers and Sweater Sets</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a risk of injuries as some of the poppers have rough edges, which could lead to infants receiving cuts or scrapes.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Clothing, textiles and fashion items – Overalls/Bodysuits</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Matalan</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales Period</td>\n      <td>13th July 2025 – 17th October 2025</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Codes</td>\n      <td>For a full list of product names and product codes, please see Annex A in the linked PDF.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>India</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Baby rompers, sweater sets and dungarees.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_905ba63b-269b-48f7-9fea-646e62876399\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/691750729d50fc2fe8161831/2511-0079-product-recall-matalan-dungarees-and-clothing__1_.pdf\">Link to product images and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a risk of injuries as some of the poppers have rough edges, which could lead to infants receiving cuts or scrapes.   </p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users.  </p>\n\n<p>Consumers should stop using the products immediately and return them to their nearest store for a refund. For more information, please visit:  <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.matalan.co.uk/customer-services/product-recall-notice.list\">Product Recall Notice - Matalan</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0079</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-14T15:54:19Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"clothing-textiles-fashion","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-11-14","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-14T15:54:19+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-re